# VERCEL-COST-2 (27 Sep 2026). Nothing here is read by `next build` or by any
# route at runtime, and together it is ~300 MB uploaded on every deployment
# (measured: _mobileqa 220 MB, _homeshots 30 MB, _p021qa 8.6 MB of committed QA
# screenshots; assets/ 22 MB; docs/ 6 MB; tests/ 6 MB). Keeping it out of the
# deployment shrinks the upload, the build's working set and what Vercel
# retains per deployment. lib/, app/, components/, public/, scripts/ and the
# config files are untouched - scripts/vercelIgnoreBuild.sh must stay.
_mobileqa
_homeshots
_p021qa
assets
docs
tests
design
.claude
.local
.social-preview
tmp
